#. その真剣な眼差し…殺したくなるぜ…
#. まーくんの言ってる意味は分かんないけどね！
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I have no idea what you're talking about, but I wanna\n"
"stab your seriously adorably serious face off!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Chính là chiếc <CLT 3>kính<CLT> của cậu ấy."
#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. その真剣な眼差し…殺したくなるぜ…
#. まーくんの言ってる意味は分かんないけどね！
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I have no idea what you're talking about, but I wanna\n"
"stab your seriously adorably serious face off!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Nhưng khi bọn mình phát hiện lại cái xác sau đó ở kho mỹ thuật..."
#. <CLT 4>メモにあった呼び出し時間…
#. そこに何か手掛かりがありそうな気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The time mentioned in the note... I feel like that's\n"
"the key.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "...nó lại sạch sẽ không tì vết."
#. <CLT 4>メモにあった呼び出し時間は、早朝６時…
#. それと同じ時間帯に起きた事…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The time on the note said 6 a.m. What happened at 6\n"
"a.m.?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Hơn nữa! Tớ còn tìm thấy thứ được cho là dùng để lau vết máu trên kính trong thùng rác ở phòng y tế đấy!"
#. <CLT 4>…それを思い出すんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's what I need to clear up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
